【来源1】{"claim": "Joanna feels a rollercoaster of emotions - relief, excitement, and some anxiety - about finishing her screenplay project.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-01-23T14:01:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Woohoo, Nate! I'm feeling a rollercoaster of emotions - relief, excitement, some anxiety - over finishing this project. Now I'm gonna submit it to some film festivals and (hopefully) get producers and directors to check it out. Here's hoping!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "Joanna submitted a screenplay to a film festival.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-02-07T09:27:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no see! The screenplay I sent in to the film festival has been on my mind all day everyday. I keep bouncing between crazy emotions like relief, excitement and worry! Fingers crossed a producer or director falls in love with it and it ends up on the big screen - that would be awesome!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "Joanna plans to consider getting pets of her own soon if she can find any she is not allergic to.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-01-23T14:01:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Good idea, Nate! I'll think about it and maybe get pets of my own soon if I can find any I'm not allergic to. Have you been up to anything recently?", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "Joanna feels relief, excitement, and worry about her submitted screenplay.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-02-07T09:27:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no see! The screenplay I sent in to the film festival has been on my mind all day everyday. I keep bouncing between crazy emotions like relief, excitement and worry! Fingers crossed a producer or director falls in love with it and it ends up on the big screen - that would be awesome!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "Joanna feels a mix of relief, anxiety, excitement, and terror about what comes next for her work.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-18T18:59:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Hey Nate, it's been a minute! I wrapped up my second script, and the feels have been wild. Sometimes I'm so relieved, but other times I just feel anxious about what comes next. It's a mix of excitement and terror, thinking about my work getting noticed and hitting the big screen.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "Joanna has been doing research and networking non-stop for her script and is determined to make it happen.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-18T18:59:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: I've been doing my fair share of research and networking non-stop for it. It's tough, but I'm determined to make it happen.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "Joanna's new screenplay was inspired by her personal experiences and her own journey of self-discovery.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-02-25T13:07:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! It was inspired by personal experiences and my own journey of self-discovery.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源8】{"claim": "Joanna says Nate's support means a lot to her and gives her motivation to keep pushing forward on her script.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-18T18:59:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Thanks so much, Nate! Your support means a lot. I'll keep working at it and hopefully the next steps will become clearer soon.", "context_only": false}, {"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-18T18:59:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Appreciated! I think just having someone to support me throughout the whole process is such a blessing. It gives me the motivation to keep pushing forward.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源9】{"claim": "Joanna has seen the movie a few times and it is one of her favorites; she likes its idea and acting.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-01-21T19:31:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: A few times. It's one of my favorites! I really like the idea and the acting.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源10】{"claim": "Joanna had been working on her screenplay for a while and feels relieved it is done.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-01-23T14:01:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: [Image: a photography of a book with a page of text on it] Woo! I finally finished my first full screenplay and printed it last Friday. I've been working on for a while, such a relief to have it all done!", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "last Friday", "start": "2022-01-21", "end_exclusive": "2022-01-22", "precision": "day", "rule": "strict_previous_or_next_weekday"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源11】{"claim": "Joanna is allergic to cockroaches, which she found out recently.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-03-18T18:59:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: I wish I wasn't allergic! I would get two turtles today if I could! I found out recently I'm allergic to cockroaches as well, so who knows if I'll ever get a pet.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "today", "start": "2022-03-18", "end_exclusive": "2022-03-19", "precision": "day", "rule": "source_relative_day"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源12】{"claim": "Joanna's first full screenplay is a mix of drama and romance.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-01-23T14:01:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! It's a mix of drama and romance!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源13】{"claim": "Joanna's new screenplay is about a thirty-year-old woman on a journey of self-discovery after a loss.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-02-25T13:07:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: It's about a thirty year old woman on a journey of self-discovery after a loss. Somewhat similar to the last one, but hey, that's just the kind of thing I'm inspired to write about!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源14】{"claim": "Joanna's pet allergy is severe: her face gets puffy and itchy around certain animals, so she has always stayed away from them.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-01-23T14:01:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Oh, its really bad. My face gets all puffy and itchy when I'm around certain animals, so I've always just stayed away.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源15】{"claim": "Joanna is not into games.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-01-21T19:31:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Cool, Nate! Sounds like a fun experience, even if I'm not into games.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源16】{"claim": "Joanna is tempted to try dairy-free flavors and considers making one or visiting Nate to try his creation.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-02-07T09:27:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: [Image: a photo of a piece of cake with berries on a plate] Wow, those sound great! Who can say no to chocolate and berries? I'm tempted to try dairy-free flavors now!", "context_only": false}, {"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-02-07T09:27:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Wow! That sounds yummy! You're so talented. Thanks for sharing your amazing creations! I should really try making one or just pay you a visit and try one for myself!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源17】{"claim": "Joanna is always willing to give movie recommendations.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-02-07T09:27:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Anytime! I'm always down to give movie reccomendations.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源18】{"claim": "Joanna's new screenplay is her own story, with the main character dealing with loss and trying to figure out who they are, taking a road trip to heal and grow.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Joanna", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-02-25T13:07:00+00:00", "text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! It's my own story. The main character is dealing with some tough stuff: loss and trying to figure out who they are. They take a road trip to heal and grow.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
